OL,3,AUK sanctions top Myanmar military
OL,4,Aleaders after Rohingya genocide ruling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK has sanctioned five senior
OL,7,FMyanmar military leaders after the
OL,8,FInternational Court of Justice (ICJ)
OL,9,Fruled that the country had carried out
OL,10,Fgenocide against the Rohingya minority
OL,11,F` marking the first time a state has
OL,12,Fbeen found guilty of the crime.
OL,14,FA military crackdown in 2017 killed
OL,15,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more
OL,16,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority
OL,17,FMyanmar, formerly known as Burma.
OL,19,FThe UK is joined by several other
OL,20,Fcountries in acknowledging the ICJ
OL,21,Fruling, including Australia, Belgium,
OL,22,FPortugal, Spain and Canada.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
